    test(lifecycle): G-S97 probe, the compendium search opened from an editing hover preview (SC-601)
    
    A measuring probe, not a landing test: a real hover, a real press on the
    preview's prose (source editor, activeEditor = the embed), the compendium
    search opened by executeCommandById, a real Ctrl+Shift+Y and the command
    palette; real presses on its input, backdrop, box and a suggestion; where
    the chosen reference lands. Controls: the note in a pane, Obsidian's quick
    switcher / command palette / Insert template from the editing preview, and
    a DseModal (the stamina bar) opened inside it. One G-S97-REC line per trial;
    it asserts only that every trial ran. Run with --only=G-S97.

